      "end_time": 7.535,
      "transcript": "ਗਉੜੀ ਮਹਲਾ ਪੰਜਵਾ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00002",
      "start_time": 15.8,
      "end_time": 23.43,
      "transcript": "ਹਰਿ ਹਰਿ ਨਾਮਿ, ਮਜਨੁ ਕਰਿ ਸੂਚੇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00003",
      "start_time": 23.43,
      "end_time": 31.335,
      "transcript": "ਕੋਟਿ ਗ੍ਰਹਣ, ਪੁੰਨ ਫਲ ਮੂਚੇ ਰਹਾਉ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00004",
      "start_time": 42.865,
      "end_time": 50.826,
      "transcript": "ਹਰਿ ਕੇ ਚਰਣ, ਰਿਦੇ ਮਹਿ ਬਸੇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00005",
      "start_time": 50.826,
      "end_time": 58.615,
      "transcript": "ਜਨਮ ਜਨਮ ਕੇ, ਕਿਲਵਿਖ ਨਸੇ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00006",
      "start_time": 58.92,
      "end_time": 66.595,
      "transcript": "ਸਾਧਸੰਗਿ, ਕੀਰਤਨ ਫਲੁ ਪਾਇਆ"
